    "16605746187190fc43": {
      "type": "product-additional",
      "blocks": {
        "86834515-6d67-4de2-8aa5-361ae0025e7c": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Overview",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>If you thought our custom curtains couldn’t get any better, they just did. Introducing four new trim options, from timeless tassels to playful pom poms. </p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"/products/sample-curtain-trim\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Trim Sample\">Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/TrimArrangement-WEB-UPDATE_aa6f6df6-9d66-44a3-82e7-b603c6b75860.jpg",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/CurtainTrim-Moodboard-Clean.jpg",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/CurtainTrim-Moodboard-Messy.jpg"
          }
        },
        "ba93773c-db9c-4919-8f51-0ea5de862d02": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Band",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>It doesn’t get more timeless than this. Our textured band trim brings a modern minimalist touch. </p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"https://pepper-home.com/products/sample-curtain-trim\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Trim Sample\">Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Grid-Band.png"
          }
        },
        "02028c99-e0cd-48a0-ba0d-ee85b9e13f89": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Tassel",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>A versatile trim that suits any style—from a traditional reading room to a breezy boho breakfast nook. </p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"https://pepper-home.com/products/sample-curtain-trim\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Trim Sample\">Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Grid-Tassel.png"
          }
        },
        "edbd427b-181e-43dd-8ae5-9466975a8cba": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Rick Rack",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>Elevated craft meets sophisticated color with rick rack trim that’s delightfully unexpected.</p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"https://pepper-home.com/products/sample-curtain-trim\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Trim Sample\">Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Grid-RickRack.png",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/FridaPink-ShowerCurtain-_katefiglerinteriors.png",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/Snow-ShowerCurtain-_MeganStokes.png"
          }
        },
        "506962c5-6bb6-4391-ab06-d56ae73480b8": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Pom Pom",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>It’s soft, it’s sweet, it’s irresistible. We love pom pom trim for cozy spaces, especially a bedroom or nursery. </p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"https://pepper-home.com/products/sample-curtain-trim\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Trim Sample\">Trim Samples</a></p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Grid-PomPom.png"
          }
        }
      },
